{"steam_appid":2067920,"steam_name":"Rogue: Genesia","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2067920/649931/6b7d66b7eae30af0cbf20b505b976887a5f4fcbe/1750745837/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1723016634","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256993998/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1723016634","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/80b8630d97a4b905c8b0206d7404a724495ff273/ss_80b8630d97a4b905c8b0206d7404a724495ff273.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785743668","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/4f57fa5c64bfc0d71e1a2ab4d4f3bb7779d05e42/ss_4f57fa5c64bfc0d71e1a2ab4d4f3bb7779d05e42.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785743668","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/ss_c852a41af5208577f76a6e01d129ccd77d452f17.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785743668","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/6aed6ac451818bc55725d755d1624cd4974ca863/ss_6aed6ac451818bc55725d755d1624cd4974ca863.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785743668","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/ss_dc2891926508cd9c02d4a1b122ceacf0d2b3797e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785743668"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk upon a new world and slay foes endangering it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/f09c98a88e0e60d841db77cf9d972155.poster.avif?t=1785743668\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/f09c98a88e0e60d841db77cf9d972155.webm?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/f09c98a88e0e60d841db77cf9d972155.mp4?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fend against vast enemy forces, reaching hundreds of foes on screen at any given time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action rogue-lite, you play as Rog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/c330cfe00ee78819aa8998fc6140f10b.poster.avif?t=1785743668\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/c330cfe00ee78819aa8998fc6140f10b.webm?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/c330cfe00ee78819aa8998fc6140f10b.mp4?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of all weapons, Rog can use anything to slay his numerous foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Kill, grow stronger, and kill some more!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.poster.avif?t=1785743668\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.webm?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/43fdaa981f5f67f9a430e0b4351ff24e.mp4?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your build from more than 300+ passive upgrades and 50+ weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.poster.avif?t=1785743668\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.webm?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/ff2fe4f51c6b14b33da44c0a570d098f.mp4?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You define Rog's adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose which path Rog takes. Feel brave enough to take on a powerful foe, or would you prefer to rest at the shop? <strong>The choice is yours!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.poster.avif?t=1785743668\" width=690 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.webm?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/a6703017648c948c1c4c2efc0d5fef00.mp4?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >80+ Powerful Artifacts to discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey, you'll collect many unique and powerful artifacts that will greatly impact your game experience. Harness their power to help you on your quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/cdd5e35446ec3f7b56c31eb16cf89cd3.poster.avif?t=1785743668\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/cdd5e35446ec3f7b56c31eb16cf89cd3.webm?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/cdd5e35446ec3f7b56c31eb16cf89cd3.mp4?t=1785743668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Different avatars with different playstyles!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you prefer guns, swords or having an army of summons kill your enemies for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067920/extras/107b2b6a898e5982f65f1c41207e61cc.avif?t=1785743668\" width=616 height=400 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-7200U @ 2.50GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 770 / Radeon 8950 HD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU is required</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5 9500 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070/RTX 3050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["Ouadi Huard"],"publishers":["Ouadi Huard","Gamersky Games"],"release_date":"7 Mar, 2025"}